{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/withdiscardingtaskgroup(returning:isolation:body:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@backDeployed(before: macOS 15.0, iOS 18.0, watchOS 11.0, tvOS 18.0, visionOS 2.0)\n","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"withDiscardingTaskGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"GroupResult","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"returning","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"returnType","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency23withDiscardingTaskGroup9returning9isolation4bodyxxm_ScA_pSgYixAA0cdE0VzYaXEtYalF0E6ResultL_xmfp","text":"GroupResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type = GroupResult.self, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isolation","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isolated","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"any","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScA","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")? = #isolation, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DiscardingTaskGroup","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency19DiscardingTaskGroupV","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/DiscardingTaskGroup","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency23withDiscardingTaskGroup9returning9isolation4bodyxxm_ScA_pSgYixAA0cdE0VzYaXEtYalF0E6ResultL_xmfp","text":"GroupResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency23withDiscardingTaskGroup9returning9isolation4bodyxxm_ScA_pSgYixAA0cdE0VzYaXEtYalF0E6ResultL_xmfp","text":"GroupResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/TaskGroup","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the child tasks as well as their results are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discarded as soon as the tasks complete. This prevents the discarding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"task group from accumulating many results waiting to be consumed, and is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"best applied in situations where the result of a child task is some form"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of side-effect."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A group "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"always"}]},{"type":"text","text":" waits for all of its child tasks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to complete before it returns. Even canceled tasks must run until"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion before this function returns."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Canceled child tasks cooperatively react to cancellation and attempt"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to return as early as possible."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"After this function returns, the task group is always empty."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is not possible to explicitly await completion of child-tasks,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"however the group will automatically await "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"all"}]},{"type":"text","text":" child task completions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before returning from this function:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["await withDiscardingTaskGroup(...) { group in","  group.addTask { \/* slow-task *\/ }","  \/\/ slow-task executes...","}","\/\/ guaranteed that slow-task has completed and the group is empty & destroyed"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Refer to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/TaskGroup","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" documentation for detailed discussion of semantics shared between all task groups."}]},{"text":"Task Group Cancellation","level":1,"type":"heading","anchor":"Task-Group-Cancellation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can cancel a task group and all of its child tasks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by calling the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/TaskGroup\/cancelAll()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method on the task group,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or by canceling the task in which the group is running."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"addTask(priority:operation:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to create a new task in a canceled group,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that task is immediately canceled after creation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Alternatively, you can call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"asyncUnlessCancelled(priority:operation:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which doesn’t create the task if the group has already been canceled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Choosing between these two functions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lets you control how to react to cancellation within a group:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"some child tasks need to run regardless of cancellation,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but other tasks are better not even being created"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when you know they can’t produce useful results."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the tasks you add to a group with this method are nonthrowing,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"those tasks can’t respond to cancellation by throwing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CancellationError"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tasks must handle cancellation in some other way,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as returning the work completed so far, returning an empty result, or returning "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For tasks that need to handle cancellation by throwing an error,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withThrowingDiscardingTaskGroup(returning:isolation:body:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method instead."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/TaskGroup","isActive":true}]}],"name":"See Also","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/withThrowingDiscardingTaskGroup(returning:isolation:body:)","isActive":true}]}],"type":"aside","name":"See Also"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Task","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documenta